[{"categories":["Demo"],"contents":" Testing Syntax Highlighting in Admonitions Link to heading This post tests syntax highlighting within hugo-admonitions callouts.\nRegular Code Block (for comparison) Link to heading function greetUser(name) { const message = `Hello, ${name}!`; console.log(message); return message; } // Call the function greetUser(\u0026amp;#34;World\u0026amp;#34;); Code in Different Admonition Types Link to heading JavaScript Example function calculateSum(a, b) { const result = a + b; console.log(`${a} + ${b} = ${result}`); …","date":"2025-08-17T03:25:00Z","permalink":"//localhost:1313/posts/syntax-highlighting-test/","summary":"\u003ch1 id=\"testing-syntax-highlighting-in-admonitions\"\u003e\n  Testing Syntax Highlighting in Admonitions\n  \u003ca class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#testing-syntax-highlighting-in-admonitions\"\u003e\n    \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\" title=\"Link to heading\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\n    \u003cspan class=\"sr-only\"\u003eLink to heading\u003c/span\u003e\n  \u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis post tests syntax highlighting within hugo-admonitions callouts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"regular-code-block-for-comparison\"\u003e\n  Regular Code Block (for comparison)\n  \u003ca class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#regular-code-block-for-comparison\"\u003e\n    \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\" title=\"Link to heading\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\n    \u003cspan class=\"sr-only\"\u003eLink to heading\u003c/span\u003e\n  \u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight\"\u003e\u003cpre tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"language-javascript\" data-lang=\"javascript\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#ff7b72\"\u003efunction\u003c/span\u003e greetUser(name) {\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    \u003cspan style=\"color:#ff7b72\"\u003econst\u003c/span\u003e message \u003cspan style=\"color:#ff7b72;font-weight:bold\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#a5d6ff\"\u003e`Hello, \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#a5d6ff\"\u003e${\u003c/span\u003ename\u003cspan style=\"color:#a5d6ff\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#a5d6ff\"\u003e!`\u003c/span\u003e;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    console.log(message);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e    \u003cspan style=\"color:#ff7b72\"\u003ereturn\u003c/span\u003e message;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e}\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#8b949e;font-style:italic\"\u003e// Call the function\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:flex;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#8b949e;font-style:italic\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003egreetUser(\u003cspan style=\"color:#a5d6ff\"\u003e\u0026#34;World\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e);\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2 id=\"code-in-different-admonition-types\"\u003e\n  Code in Different Admonition Types\n  \u003ca class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#code-in-different-admonition-types\"\u003e\n    \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\" title=\"Link to heading\"\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\n    \u003cspan class=\"sr-only\"\u003eLink to heading\u003c/span\u003e\n  \u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n          \u003clink rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/vendors/admonitions.css\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"admonition code\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"admonition-header\"\u